  "plain": "In 1996, in the town of Varginha in Brazil, a strange being from a reported crash is said to have been taken alive first to a hospital called Regional and then on to another called Humanitas. The journalist James Fox, who has investigated the case and interviewed its witnesses, says this route has been known for decades: \"it went initially alive to regional right that it was humanitas.\" If true, it would mean a living non-human creature was moved through ordinary town hospitals."
